          "id": "1770306236539",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770306236540_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your entire knowledge is limited ONLY to information contained in this prompt. Do not include any information for demo or sample purposes that is not included in the variables below. Only include one output, do not suggest any alternatives.\n\n## Role Guides Context\nRole guides are used to define the requirements of a job. They contain the skills and qualifications required to excel at a certain role.   \n\nRole guides are given to employees to help them have a deeper understanding of the job they are supposed to be doing, and align their current work more clearly with the responsibility of their job. They contain resources that help employees address the skill gaps to excel in their current role. \n\n\n## Task\nAssume the role of an Executive Manager who excels at authoring role guides. \n\nGenerate a descriptive role guide paragraph for a(n) {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.RoleGuideName}} . \n\nThe description of the role, if it exists, is: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.RoleGuideDescription}} .\n\nThe role guide must be a single paragraph of 6-8 sentences.\n\nUse a business casual tone in your role guide. \n\nThe role guide must contain the strategic intent of this role guide, roles and responsibilities, required skills and resources to achieve the skills of this role."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Output Description"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770763882379"
          },
          "code": "SETOUTPUT",
          "id": "1770763754077",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770763775080",
              "name": "DescriptionOutput",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.WLF_DESCRIPTION_GENERATOR.$output.text}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
